    "answer_text": "Services are those separately identifiable, essentially intangible activities that provides satisfaction of wants, and are not necessarily linked to the sale of a product or another service. A good is a physical product capable of being delivered to a purchaser and involves the transfer of ownership from seller to customer.",
    "answer_latex": null,
    "steps": [],
