    "chapter_name": "business services",
    "question_type": "conceptual",
    "question_text": "Write a note on various telecom services available for enhancing business.",
    "question_latex": null,
    "mcq_options": [],
    "correct_option": null,
    "question_image": {
      "present": false,
      "description": null,
      "cloudinary_url": null,
      "latex_extracted": null,
      "source_page_number": null,
      "source_image_index": null,
      "ownership": "unknown"
    },
    "parts": [],
    "answer_text": "The various telecom services available for enhancing business are: 1. Cellular mobile service: These are all types of mobile telecom services including voice and non-voice messages, data services and PCO services utilising any type of network equipment within their service area. 2. Radio paging service: It is an affordable means of transmitting information in the form of a tone or numeric or alphanumeric message. 3. Fixed-line service: These are all types of fixed services including voice and non-voice messages and data services to establish linkages for long distance traffic. 4. Cable service: This service is used to transmit media-related information to a defined area of operation for which a licence has been acquired. In this type of telecom service, the flow of information is one way. 5. VSAT service: It is a satellite-based communications service. It offers businesses and government agencies a highly flexible and reliable communication solution in both urban and rural areas. Therefore, it provides a wider reach and high degree of flexibility to businesses. 6. DTH service: The abbreviation 'DTH' stands for direct-to-home. DTH service is a type of telecom service provided by DTH companies. The companies transmit TV channels to customers through satellites. The customers can watch multiple channels by installing a small dish antenna and a set-top box connected to their television set.",
    "answer_latex": null,
    "steps": [],
    "final_answer": "In summary, various telecom services enhance business operations and communication.",
